{"id":"121b0e0f0f7736f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-graph-clique.md","title":"ZFC Graph Clique","display":"df-zfc-graph-clique — ZFC Graph Clique","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-clique","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-clique"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-clique — ZFC Graph Clique","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-clique"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-clique</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-clique — ZFC Graph Clique"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,G\\in V\">\\(C,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S(C,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land [C]^2\\subseteq E\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S(C,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land [C]^2\\subseteq E\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph carrier is bound as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, not as the ambient universe symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-graph]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphClique}_S(C,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land [C]^2\\subseteq E\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":791,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-graph-clique.md|58-df-zfc-graph-clique]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}